{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）上午9時24分，警方接報，藍田康盈苑一名女子懷疑從高處墮下，並倒臥在簷篷位置。救援人員到場證實21歲姓鄭歲女事主當場不治，人員經初步調查，相信事主從上址一後樓梯墮下，消防員將遺體從簷篷移入後樓梯。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，據了解，事主患有情緒病。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是康盈苑。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146763371895721984452607.jpeg/sJNj8UedLQ_dkLD0KohF3KLIC2sJXkym1vBjddbwY3U\"/><figcaption>現場是康盈苑。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以黑色膠袋包裹遺體。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146763369148321792195876.jpeg/Z_I6uWFRcR9sUX58Lho-7Gj8MsfxePOqg6QQqIOkEKg\"/><figcaption>人員以黑色膠袋包裹遺體。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146763365494951936296718.jpeg/n3zfYATBX4HExwcNLctmmtBHcQ3eOa6p01wi1NNcItQ\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146763362823049216937821.jpeg/P6neIbgU2lU5pdfOF9003Vx76GfrEHnuEQ7mlxEO5pc\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T05:51:33.982168+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}